    {
      "page_number": 1,
      "excerpt": "What is the overall deductible? Designated Network and Network: $1,700 Individual / $3,400 Family; out-of-Network: $5,000 Individual / $10,000 Family Per Calendar year."
    },
    {
      "page_number": 1,
      "excerpt": "What is the out-of-pocket limit for this plan? Designated Network and Network: $4,500 Individual / $9,000 Family; out-of-Network: $10,000 Individual / $20,000 Family. (The extraction carries the $9,000 family limit; the $4,500 individual limit is stated here and was omitted rather than misassigned from a fragmented source cell.)"
    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "excerpt": "Primary care visit to treat an injury or illness: $10 copay per visit (Designated Network and Network); 40% coinsurance out-of-Network"
