    },
    {
      "page_number": 2,
      "excerpt": "Imaging (CT/PET scans, MRIs): Designated Network $150 copay per service / Free Standing/Office $500 copay per service; 40% coinsurance out-of-Network. (The extraction carries the Designated Network value.)"
