      "excerpt": "Tier 1 - Your Lowest-Cost Option: Retail: $10 copay. Tier 2 - Your Midrange-Cost Option: Retail: $40 copay. Tier 3 - Your Midrange-Cost Option: Retail: $75 copay. Tier 4 - Additional High-Cost Options: Retail: $125 copay. (Mail-order and specialty-pharmacy prices are stated in the document; the extraction carries the retail values.)"
    },
    {
